    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχαΐνης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ̆] ἔλαφος</span>
